msgstr "基于 JWKS 的 ES256 ID token 验签、按 state 持久化的 PKCE 和 refresh single-flight 已实现并完成本地测试。真实设备和 IdP 验证前仍不具备 L4 支持。"

#: apps/site/src/content-source/docs/message-descriptors.ts
msgid "JWKS-backed ES256/RS256 ID token verification and end_session logout are implemented and locally tested. Real macOS Keychain and IdP round-trip validation is still required before L4 support."
msgstr "基于 JWKS 的 ES256/RS256 ID token 验签和 end_session 登出已实现并完成本地测试。真实 macOS Keychain 和 IdP 往返验证前仍不具备 L4 支持。"

#: apps/site/src/content-source/docs/message-descriptors.ts
msgid "JWKS-backed ES256/RS256 ID token verification, end_session logout, and refresh single-flight are implemented and locally tested. A real IdP round-trip on an iOS device or simulator is still required before L4 support."
msgstr "基于 JWKS 的 ES256/RS256 ID token 验签、end_session 登出和 refresh single-flight 已实现并完成本地测试。真实 iOS 设备或模拟器上的 IdP 往返验证前仍不具备 L4 支持。"

#: apps/site/src/content-source/docs/message-descriptors.ts
msgid "JWKS-backed ID token verification and cache refresh are implemented and locally tested. A desktop Secret Service and real IdP round-trip are still required before L4 support."
msgstr "基于 JWKS 的 ID token 验签和缓存刷新已实现并完成本地测试。桌面 Secret Service 和真实 IdP 往返验证前仍不具备 L4 支持。"

#: apps/site/src/content-source/docs/message-descriptors.ts
